{
    "title": "Baby Piano: Kids Music Games",
    "description": "Bimi Boo kids piano game is a music game for toddlers of 1 to 5 years old. Our learning game for girls and boys will allow your toddlers to develop creativity, an ear for music, hand-eye coordination, fine motor and attention.\r\n\r\nOur baby piano game features 5 entertaining and educational games for toddlers. Baby piano for kids & toddlers game by Bimi Boo is perfect for pre-k and preschool education. It is also suitable for kids with developmental disorders, such as autism.\r\n\r\nBaby piano include 5 games for toddlers to enjoy music:\r\n\r\nNursery rhymes. There are 8 classic simple songs for your kid to enjoy:\r\n- Jingle Bells\r\n- Happy Birthday\r\n- Twinkle Twinkle Little Star\r\n- Old MacDonald Had a Farm\r\n- Pop Goes the Weasel\r\n- The Muffin Man\r\n- Wheels on the Bus\r\n- Five Little Monkeys\r\n\r\nMusical Instruments for toddlers. Kids can use a variety of instruments to play on \u2013 piano, drums, bells, flute, guitar, trumpet, harmonic and tambourine. Great animations featuring cool characters will ensure an amazing experience for kids ages 2 to 5.\r\n\r\nDifferent sounds for kids. Being not only entertaining but also educational, this games for toddlers will allow your kid to learn sounds of different animals, vehicles and much more! Baby piano contains 60 amazing sounds for kids across 6 awesome sets:\r\n- Animal sounds\r\n- Vehicle sounds\r\n- Kids\u2019 sounds\r\n- Robot sounds\r\n- Alien sounds\r\n- Environment sounds\r\n\r\nLullabies for babies and toddlers. 8 outstanding lullabies will help your sweet baby to fall asleep. Let your kid to choose a lovely character to watch them fall asleep while listening to a bedtime song.\r\n\r\nLearning games for kids. 8 educational music games for toddlers to choose from. Help Bimi Boo in his adventures at different locations. Baby piano for kids & toddlers will help your girls and boys to develop love for music. The games for toddlers are perfect for 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5 year olds.\r\n\r\nThe following content is available for free:\r\n- 20+ ambient sounds.\r\n- 2 music instruments.\r\n- 2 popular songs for babies.\r\n- 2 baby games.\r\n- 2 lullabies.\r\n\r\nPlease kindly note that an in-app purchase is required to unlock additional content. Baby piano is a game that doesn\u2019t require Wi-Fi to be played and you will never find annoying ads inside our apps. We are always glad to receive your feedback and suggestions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bimi Boo kids piano game is a music game for toddlers of 1 to 5 years old. Our learning game for girls and boys will allow your toddlers to develop creativity, an ear for music, hand-eye coordination, fine motor and attention.<br><br>Our baby piano game features 5 entertaining and educational games for toddlers. Baby piano for kids &amp; toddlers game by Bimi Boo is perfect for pre-k and preschool education. It is also suitable for kids with developmental disorders, such as autism.<br><br>Baby piano include 5 games for toddlers to enjoy music:<br><br>Nursery rhymes. There are 8 classic simple songs for your kid to enjoy:<br>- Jingle Bells<br>- Happy Birthday<br>- Twinkle Twinkle Little Star<br>- Old MacDonald Had a Farm<br>- Pop Goes the Weasel<br>- The Muffin Man<br>- Wheels on the Bus<br>- Five Little Monkeys<br><br>Musical Instruments for toddlers. Kids can use a variety of instruments to play on \u2013 piano, drums, bells, flute, guitar, trumpet, harmonic and tambourine. Great animations featuring cool characters will ensure an amazing experience for kids ages 2 to 5.<br><br>Different sounds for kids. Being not only entertaining but also educational, this games for toddlers will allow your kid to learn sounds of different animals, vehicles and much more! Baby piano contains 60 amazing sounds for kids across 6 awesome sets:<br>- Animal sounds<br>- Vehicle sounds<br>- Kids\u2019 sounds<br>- Robot sounds<br>- Alien sounds<br>- Environment sounds<br><br>Lullabies for babies and toddlers. 8 outstanding lullabies will help your sweet baby to fall asleep. Let your kid to choose a lovely character to watch them fall asleep while listening to a bedtime song.<br><br>Learning games for kids. 8 educational music games for toddlers to choose from. Help Bimi Boo in his adventures at different locations. Baby piano for kids &amp; toddlers will help your girls and boys to develop love for music. The games for toddlers are perfect for 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5 year olds.<br><br>The following content is available for free:<br>- 20+ ambient sounds.<br>- 2 music instruments.<br>- 2 popular songs for babies.<br>- 2 baby games.<br>- 2 lullabies.<br><br>Please kindly note that an in-app purchase is required to unlock additional content. Baby piano is a game that doesn\u2019t require Wi-Fi to be played and you will never find annoying ads inside our apps. We are always glad to receive your feedback and suggestions.",
